Placeholder for the pd-sb-key flake input. Secure Boot images need the PureDarwin MOK key pair,
which never goes in the repo. Build them with

  nix build .#image-gpu-sb --override-input pd-sb-key path:/path/to/keydir

where keydir holds MOK.key, MOK.pem and MOK.cer, made once with

  openssl req -new -x509 -newkey rsa:2048 -nodes -sha256 -days 3650 \
    -subj "/CN=PureDarwin Secure Boot MOK/" -keyout MOK.key -out MOK.pem
  openssl x509 -in MOK.pem -outform DER -out MOK.cer
